 attributable to continuous improvement in our user retention rate and a significant increase in the number of paying users driven by pay for streaming as the willingness of users to pay for our premium music service improved substantially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/tencent-music-entertainment-group-tme-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"TME 2019 Q3","e":"tme","d":"2019-11-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Cussion Pang","x":"We also launched target programs for students such as the subscription plan promotional events during summer holiday and a streaming program called a summer fan appreciation, inviting the idol fever.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/tencent-music-entertainment-group-tme-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"TME 2019 Q3","e":"tme","d":"2019-11-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Zhijing Liu","x":"I have only one question is that online video companies has mentioned a possibility of price hike in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/tencent-music-entertainment-group-tme-q3-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"TME 2019 Q4","e":"tme","d":"2020-03-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Kar Shun Pang","x":"Our strategic transaction to pay for streaming service, continuous investment in premium self-produced and licensed content, product upgrades, and technological enhancements have led to better user retention, attracting more subscribers, content creators, performers and users to our widened…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/19/tencent-music-entertainment-group-tme-q4-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"TME 2019 Q4","e":"tme","d":"2020-03-18","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Kar Shun Pang","x":"And streaming of this original work as a proportion of all streams also nearly doubled from a year ago, with even more explosive growth for our exclusive indie musicians.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/19/tencent-musi